{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2022-06-27 17:01:00', 'title': 'CARSALES.COM LTD TO PURCHASE 100% OF TRADER INTERACTIVE', 'text': "THE LARGEST ONLINE MARKETPLACE IN AUSTRALIA TO ADD TRADER INTERACTIVE'S US MARKETPLACES TO THEIR BRAND PORTFOLIO\xa0\xa0 \xa0 VIRGINIA BEACH, VA. , JUNE 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARSALES.COM LTD (CARSALES), THE LARGEST ONLINE MARKETPLACE IN AUSTRALIA FOCUSING ON THE AUTOMOTIVE, MOTORCYCLE, AND MARINE REALMS, HAS ANNOUNCED THE INTENTION TO PURCHASE THE REMAINING 51% OF TRADER INTERACTIVE FROM THE CURRENT INVESTORS, EURAZEO AND GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT TO BRING THEIR HOLDING UP TO 100%."}